  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.2 makes product-detail enrichment best-effort during affiliate link generation: when GenerateAffiliateLinkAsync(IncludeProductDetails=true) succeeds on the link.generate call but the follow-up productdetail.get call fails (e.g. ApiCallLimit rate limiting, internal timeout, or non-catalog product), the already-generated affiliate link is now returned WITHOUT product details instead of throwing and discarding the link. Caller cancellation still propagates. 1.2.1 was a maintenance release (CI workflow + package metadata, no API changes). 1.2.0 adds AliExpressAffiliateCredentialException and AliExpressAffiliateCredentialFailureKind so callers can distinguish rejected AliExpress Open Platform credentials from transient HTTP failures and non-affiliable products. HTTP 401/403 and Open Platform signature/app key/session/permission errors now surface as non-retryable credential failures.",
